# Platformer Game

This repository contains a very simple platformer game implemented in a single
`index.html` file using [three.js](https://threejs.org/).

## How to Play

Open `index.html` in a modern web browser. Use the arrow keys or `A`/`D` to move
left and right. Press `W`, `Arrow Up`, or `Space` to jump. Reach the yellow goal
cube at the end of the platforms to win.
